From: Eloise Pozzi <eloise@canva.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 11:15:50 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: advertise PyInfo from pycross_wheel_library

Backport of https://github.com/jvolkman/rules_pycross/pull/275 to
rules_pycross 0.8.3.
---
 pycross/private/wheel_library.bzl | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/pycross/private/wheel_library.bzl b/pycross/private/wheel_library.bzl
--- a/pycross/private/wheel_library.bzl
+++ b/pycross/private/wheel_library.bzl
@@ -94,6 +94,7 @@ def _pycross_wheel_library_impl(ctx):
 
 pycross_wheel_library = rule(
     implementation = _pycross_wheel_library_impl,
+    provides = [PyInfo],
     attrs = {
         "deps": attr.label_list(
             doc = "A list of this wheel's Python library dependencies.",
